{"id": "DEF-01", "kind": "definition", "text": "Граница — Поверхность, которую надо поддерживать, ценой вещества.", "mode": "formal", "context": {"scope": "line definition, vocabulary v1"}, "epistemic": "hypothesis", "provenance": "verified_agent", "evidence": [{"kind": "document", "ref": "docs/ELEPHANT-MAP.md", "strength": "strong"}], "relations": [], "data": {"defines": "granica", "version": 1, "boundary_rules": [{"a": "granica", "b": "porog", "rule": "предмет, который удерживают -> granica; смена режима по параметру -> porog"}]}, "created_at": "2026-11-21", "updated_at": "2026-11-21"}
{"id": "DEF-02", "kind": "definition", "text": "Обмен — Поток вещества внутрь и наружу, с потерей.", "mode": "formal", "context": {"scope": "line definition, vocabulary v1"}, "epistemic": "hypothesis", "provenance": "verified_agent", "evidence": [{"kind": "document", "ref": "docs/ELEPHANT-MAP.md", "strength": "strong"}], "relations": [], "data": {"defines": "obmen", "version": 1, "boundary_rules": []}, "created_at": "2026-11-21", "updated_at": "2026-11-21"}
{"id": "DEF-03", "kind": "definition", "text": "Свои условия — Система меняет то, от чего зависит.", "mode": "formal", "context": {"scope": "line definition, vocabulary v1"}, "epistemic": "hypothesis", "provenance": "verified_agent", "evidence": [{"kind": "document", "ref": "docs/ELEPHANT-MAP.md", "strength": "strong"}], "relations": [], "data": {"defines": "svoi-usloviya", "version": 1, "boundary_rules": [{"a": "individualnost", "b": "svoi-usloviya", "rule": "различимость единицы -> individualnost; влияние на среду -> svoi-usloviya"}]}, "created_at": "2026-11-21", "updated_at": "2026-11-21"}
{"id": "DEF-04", "kind": "definition", "text": "Организация с разделением — Части делают то, чего целое не может само.", "mode": "formal", "context": {"scope": "line definition, vocabulary v1"}, "epistemic": "hypothesis", "provenance": "verified_agent", "evidence": [{"kind": "document", "ref": "docs/ELEPHANT-MAP.md", "strength": "strong"}], "relations": [], "data": {"defines": "organizaciya", "version": 1, "boundary_rules": []}, "created_at": "2026-11-21", "updated_at": "2026-11-21"}
{"id": "DEF-05", "kind": "definition", "text": "Прошлое — Две системы с равным состоянием не равны.", "mode": "formal", "context": {"scope": "line definition, vocabulary v1"}, "epistemic": "hypothesis", "provenance": "verified_agent", "evidence": [{"kind": "document", "ref": "docs/ELEPHANT-MAP.md", "strength": "strong"}], "relations": [], "data": {"defines": "proshloe", "version": 1, "boundary_rules": []}, "created_at": "2026-11-21", "updated_at": "2026-11-21"}
{"id": "DEF-06", "kind": "definition", "text": "Смерть — Отказ как скорость, а не как бит.", "mode": "formal", "context": {"scope": "line definition, vocabulary v1"}, "epistemic": "hypothesis", "provenance": "verified_agent", "evidence": [{"kind": "document", "ref": "docs/ELEPHANT-MAP.md", "strength": "strong"}], "relations": [], "data": {"defines": "smert", "version": 1, "boundary_rules": []}, "created_at": "2026-11-21", "updated_at": "2026-11-21"}
{"id": "DEF-07", "kind": "definition", "text": "Порог и критичность — Переход между режимами по параметру.", "mode": "formal", "context": {"scope": "line definition, vocabulary v1"}, "epistemic": "hypothesis", "provenance": "verified_agent", "evidence": [{"kind": "document", "ref": "docs/ELEPHANT-MAP.md", "strength": "strong"}], "relations": [], "data": {"defines": "porog", "version": 1, "boundary_rules": [{"a": "granica", "b": "porog", "rule": "предмет, который удерживают -> granica; смена режима по параметру -> porog"}]}, "created_at": "2026-11-21", "updated_at": "2026-11-21"}
{"id": "DEF-08", "kind": "definition", "text": "Выбор — Деление ресурса между назначениями.", "mode": "formal", "context": {"scope": "line definition, vocabulary v1"}, "epistemic": "hypothesis", "provenance": "verified_agent", "evidence": [{"kind": "document", "ref": "docs/ELEPHANT-MAP.md", "strength": "strong"}], "relations": [], "data": {"defines": "vybor", "version": 1, "boundary_rules": [{"a": "vybor", "b": "agentnost", "rule": "механизм распределения -> vybor; норма/критерий действия -> agentnost"}]}, "created_at": "2026-11-21", "updated_at": "2026-11-21"}
{"id": "DEF-09", "kind": "definition", "text": "Индивидуальность — Граница «я» как измерение, а не статус.", "mode": "formal", "context": {"scope": "line definition, vocabulary v1"}, "epistemic": "hypothesis", "provenance": "verified_agent", "evidence": [{"kind": "document", "ref": "docs/ELEPHANT-MAP.md", "strength": "strong"}], "relations": [], "data": {"defines": "individualnost", "version": 1, "boundary_rules": [{"a": "individualnost", "b": "svoi-usloviya", "rule": "различимость единицы -> individualnost; влияние на среду -> svoi-usloviya"}]}, "created_at": "2026-11-21", "updated_at": "2026-11-21"}
{"id": "DEF-10", "kind": "definition", "text": "Агентность — «Что форма делает», а не «чем является».", "mode": "formal", "context": {"scope": "line definition, vocabulary v1"}, "epistemic": "hypothesis", "provenance": "verified_agent", "evidence": [{"kind": "document", "ref": "docs/ELEPHANT-MAP.md", "strength": "strong"}], "relations": [], "data": {"defines": "agentnost", "version": 1, "boundary_rules": [{"a": "vybor", "b": "agentnost", "rule": "механизм распределения -> vybor; норма/критерий действия -> agentnost"}]}, "created_at": "2026-11-21", "updated_at": "2026-11-21"}
